{"title":"Build Our Machine","artist":"DAGames","date":"2026-08-01","sourceId":"14489268:017","sourceHash":"386cd25915204301c7acf2a925a0339e85523323235656e699ea8c8a9aa5e074","duration":240.92,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":10.53,"end":11.85,"text":"They have sent you a letter","translation":"그들은 네게 편지를 보냈어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":11.85,"end":13.49,"text":"To come back home to play","translation":"집으로 돌아와 놀라고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":13.49,"end":14.53,"text":"But to your dismay","translation":"하지만 네가 실망하게도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":14.53,"end":15.41,"text":"This isn't your day","translation":"오늘은 네 날이 아니야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":15.41,"end":17.69,"text":"For the happy fun time has begun to fade","translation":"즐겁고 행복했던 시간은 이제 사라지기 시작했으니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":17.69,"end":21.27,"text":"Watch as we reanimate our corpses you abandoned","translation":"네가 버려둔 우리 시체를 되살리는 걸 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":21.61,"end":23.09,"text":"We're dismantled, we're mishandled","translation":"우린 해체되고 함부로 다뤄졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":23.09,"end":24.95,"text":"But we won't be skipped and swayed","translation":"그래도 우린 무시당하고 휘둘리진 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":24.95,"end":26.59,"text":"Trapped within these walls","translation":"이 벽 안에 갇힌 채","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":26.59,"end":28.19,"text":"You left our souls to drip away","translation":"넌 우리 영혼이 흘러 사라지게 했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":28.19,"end":30.25,"text":"The ink decays, the walls at bay","translation":"잉크는 썩고 벽은 막아 서지만","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":30.25,"end":31.93,"text":"But the reckoning has come today","translation":"오늘 심판이 찾아왔어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":31.93,"end":32.39,"text":"You say","translation":"넌 말하지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":32.39,"end":34.21,"text":"Boris has no guts 'cause you","translation":"보리스는 내장이 없다고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":34.21,"end":36.03,"text":"replaced it with mechanical strain","translation":"네가 기계 장치로 바꿔서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":36.03,"end":37.79,"text":"We've been tortured but we move forward","translation":"우린 고문당했지만 앞으로 나아가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":37.79,"end":39.81,"text":"This disorder kills your day!","translation":"이 혼란이 네 하루를 죽여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":40.33,"end":44.21,"text":"I am alive, immortalized","translation":"난 살아 있어 불멸이 되었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":44.21,"end":46.85,"text":"You're the creator, you traitor","translation":"넌 창조주이자 배신자야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":46.85,"end":51.53,"text":"Hey! There's no vaccine to cure our dirty needs","translation":"이봐 우리의 더러운 욕망을 고칠 백신은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":51.53,"end":53.87,"text":"For now, you must build up our machine","translation":"이제 너는 우리 기계를 만들어야 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":53.87,"end":58.61,"text":"You die tonight, tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어 오늘 밤","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":58.61,"end":61.52,"text":"Build up our machine","translation":"우리 기계를 만들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":61.52,"end":64.58,"text":"You die tonight, tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어 오늘 밤","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":65.94,"end":68.92,"text":"Build up our machine","translation":"우리 기계를 만들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":68.92,"end":70.1,"text":"You die tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":73.5,"end":76.28,"text":"So, you found all the pieces to initiate the pain","translation":"그래 너는 고통을 시작할 모든 조각을 찾았어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":76.28,"end":78.12,"text":"Our venom stains, the night remains","translation":"우리 독은 얼룩지고 밤은 남아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":78.12,"end":80.48,"text":"But the ending is always just the same, no gain","translation":"하지만 끝은 늘 똑같아 아무것도 얻지 못해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":80.48,"end":82.26,"text":"Nod your head to the beat of death","translation":"죽음의 비트에 맞춰 고개를 끄덕여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":82.26,"end":84.02,"text":"As you draw your last eternal breath","translation":"마지막 영원의 숨을 내쉴 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":84.02,"end":86.18,"text":"Sensations of an invasion start","translation":"침입의 감각이 흐르기 시작해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":86.18,"end":87.36,"text":"to course right through your veins","translation":"네 혈관을 타고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":87.36,"end":89.24,"text":"You say we have no brains","translation":"넌 우리가 뇌가 없다고 말하지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":89.24,"end":91.06,"text":"We're just cartoons for your portrayal","translation":"우린 네가 그려 내는 만화일 뿐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":91.06,"end":92.9,"text":"To tell some tale about a boat and sail","translation":"배와 돛에 관한 어떤 이야기를 들려주려고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":92.9,"end":95.2,"text":"But sure, this inevitably unveils the fail","translation":"하지만 그래 결국 이건 실패를 드러내","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":95.2,"end":97.22,"text":"Splashes of eternal hate will","translation":"영원한 증오의 물보라가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":97.22,"end":98.7,"text":"flood the floor and clean your slate","translation":"바닥을 뒤덮고 네 기록을 지워","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":98.7,"end":100.54,"text":"Now, we're the tools and you're the fool","translation":"이제 우린 도구고 넌 바보야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":100.54,"end":102.02,"text":"Our nightmare dominates!","translation":"우리 악몽이 지배해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":103.19,"end":107.05,"text":"I am alive, immortalized","translation":"난 살아 있어 불멸이 되었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":107.05,"end":109.83,"text":"You're the creator, you traitor","translation":"넌 창조주이자 배신자야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":109.83,"end":114.23,"text":"Hey! There's no vaccine to cure our dirty needs","translation":"이봐 우리의 더러운 욕망을 고칠 백신은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":114.23,"end":116.75,"text":"For now, you must build up our machine","translation":"이제 너는 우리 기계를 만들어야 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":116.75,"end":117.61,"text":"You die tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":117.61,"end":121.77,"text":"I am alive, immortalized","translation":"난 살아 있어 불멸이 되었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":121.77,"end":124.67,"text":"You're the creator, you traitor","translation":"넌 창조주이자 배신자야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":124.67,"end":128.95,"text":"Hey! There's no vaccine to cure our dirty needs","translation":"이봐 우리의 더러운 욕망을 고칠 백신은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":128.95,"end":131.49,"text":"For now, you must build up our machine","translation":"이제 너는 우리 기계를 만들어야 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":131.49,"end":134.59,"text":"You die tonight, tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어 오늘 밤","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":136.11,"end":138.91,"text":"Build up our machine","translation":"우리 기계를 만들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":138.91,"end":141.99,"text":"You die tonight, tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어 오늘 밤","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":143.45,"end":146.31,"text":"Build up our machine","translation":"우리 기계를 만들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":146.31,"end":147.69,"text":"You die tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":148.05,"end":149.05,"text":"I am aware","translation":"난 알고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":149.05,"end":151.67,"text":"That your soul is now divine","translation":"이제 네 영혼은 신성해졌다는 걸","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":151.67,"end":154.79,"text":"We care to not toil with unbroken chains","translation":"우린 끊어지지 않는 사슬에 매여 고생하지 않으려 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":154.79,"end":157.43,"text":"So don't toil with ours like he did","translation":"우리에게도 그러지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":157.43,"end":159.23,"text":"to our shining stars","translation":"그가 우리 빛나는 별들에게 한 것처럼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":159.23,"end":163.35,"text":"So prepare for adventure","translation":"그러니 모험을 준비해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":163.43,"end":166.61,"text":"We're a whole new creature from the darkest side","translation":"우린 가장 어두운 곳에서 온 완전히 새로운 존재야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":166.61,"end":169.63,"text":"You can't take away the pain we feel","translation":"넌 우리가 느끼는 고통을 빼앗을 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":169.63,"end":172.13,"text":"Created as monsters that come to life!","translation":"살아 움직이는 괴물로 만들어졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":172.13,"end":173.47,"text":"(Come back to life)","translation":"다시 살아나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":176.7,"end":178.18,"text":"So, you've come to the end now","translation":"그래 이제 너는 끝에 다다랐어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":178.18,"end":179.58,"text":"Alive but dead inside","translation":"살아 있지만 속은 죽었지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":179.58,"end":180.7,"text":"The heart beats loud","translation":"심장은 크게 뛰고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":180.7,"end":181.6,"text":"You've joined our crowd","translation":"넌 우리 무리에 들어왔어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":181.6,"end":183.28,"text":"We are but punished serpentines","translation":"우린 벌받은 뱀들일 뿐이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":183.34,"end":185.3,"text":"Your life with him was fun","translation":"그와 함께한 네 삶은 즐거웠어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":185.3,"end":187.32,"text":"But now the terror's only just begun","translation":"하지만 이제 공포는 막 시작됐어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":187.32,"end":189.26,"text":"Now come with me and you will see","translation":"이제 나와 함께 오면 보게 될 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":189.26,"end":190.78,"text":"We're a new-born cyanide!","translation":"우린 갓 태어난 독이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":192.46,"end":196.1,"text":"I am alive, immortalized","translation":"난 살아 있어 불멸이 되었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":196.1,"end":198.52,"text":"You're the creator, you traitor","translation":"넌 창조주이자 배신자야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":198.52,"end":202.89,"text":"Hey! There's no vaccine to cure our dirty needs","translation":"이봐 우리의 더러운 욕망을 고칠 백신은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":202.89,"end":205.37,"text":"For now you must build up our machine",